                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Convention.</hi></head>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#italic">Signed at Washington, June 24, 1910;
                        ratification advised by the Senate December 12, 1910; ratified by the
                        President, January 23, 1911; ratified by Mexico, December 27, 1910;
                        ratifications exchanged at Washington, January 24, 1911; proclaimed, January
                        25, 1911.</hi></p>

